# Every hidden file and directory, first and without exception. A tool that
# drops a cache or a log directory at the root of the plugin must not be able to
# leak it into a published release, and Plugin Check does not always catch it.
.*

# Development tooling and repository paperwork. The published package carries
# readme.txt, which is what the plugin directory reads.
/build/
/docs/
/tests/
/vendor/
/composer.json
/composer.lock
/phpcs.xml.dist
/CHANGELOG.md
/CONTRIBUTING.md
/README.md
